herdl-connection-identity

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Make HerDL client, daemon, endpoint, API, handoff, and remote bridge connections fail closed against official Herdr.
Upstream-Status: inappropriate: downstream HerDL connection identity
Drop-When: The HerDL downstream product is retired.
